      "message": "depth prevents to get out of the initial node when calling `next_*`.\n\nFor example, let say we want to navigate this.\n\n```dts\n/ {\n  parent {\n    start {\n      boy { };\n      girl {\n        dolls { };      \n      }\n    };\n  };\n  uncle { };\n};\n```\n\nIf we start calling `next_*` from `start`, we wouldn\u0027t want to navigate `uncle` while iterating. `fdt_next_node()` stops navigation when `depth` becomes negative.",
